  <prompt>Verify FR-13 URL-param error handling in NotepadShell: missing regardingEntity or regardingId renders Fluent v9 MessageBar with error text and a Close button that dismisses the modal (via window.parent.postMessage or window.close). Refine copy per U-01 unresolved question.</prompt>

  <role>Spaarke platform developer. Fluent v9 + Xrm.Navigation modal-close conventions.</role>

  <goal>MessageBar renders with error on missing params; Close button dismisses cleanly; documented in notes/.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Spec FR-13 error path. NotepadShell early-returns MessageBar when useLaunchContext returns valid=false. U-01 flagged unclear close mechanism.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>src/solutions/Notepad/src/components/NotepadShell.tsx</file>
      <file>src/solutions/Notepad/src/components/__tests__/NotepadShell.test.tsx</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

