  <steps>
    <step order="1">In NotepadShell, if useLaunchContext returns valid=false: return &lt;MessageBar intent="error"&gt;{launchContext.error}&lt;/MessageBar&gt; with a Close button.</step>
    <step order="2">Close button handler: try window.close() first; if that fails, send postMessage to window.parent with a "notepad-close" event; else no-op.</step>
    <step order="3">Add test case: missing regardingId → MessageBar renders; click on Close invokes window.close (mocked).</step>
    <step order="4">Run tests.</step>
    <step order="5">Update TASK-INDEX.md: mark 038 ✅.</step>
    <step order="6">Document U-01 resolution in notes/close-mechanism.md.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools><tool name="npm">Build + test</tool></tools>

